  "description": "Standalone file system nodes for FluxFlow: file.read and file.write transforms (request in, result out), plus directory.enumerate and file.watch sources. Built on FluxFlow.Nodes with broadcast output/error/event ports. No engine required.",
  "id": "FluxFlow.Components.FileSystem",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-19T12:53:16.967Z",
