  "published": "2026-06-19T12:50:32.38Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Rebuilt as standalone nodes over FluxFlow.Nodes: file.read and file.write are FlowNode transforms (FileReadRequest/FileWriteRequest in, FileReadResult/FileWriteResult out), and directory.enumerate and file.watch are FlowSources started with StartAsync. Every message travels as a FlowMessage<T> envelope and the correlation id flows request -> result. The engine registry, module, node factory, ports, component types, design-metadata provider, and JSON option reader are removed; construct each node directly with its options and a TimeProvider. The package depends only on FluxFlow.Nodes and runs without the engine.",
